Z||000005||fiero_nightmare||12-29-2001||02:57 PM||||yes they came with brand new tires  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> . Beretta wheels do fit but the offset is different so you cant have the weights on the rear on the rim on the rear end of the car otherwise they will hit part of the strut.  i am using 2 1/4 inch spacers on the rear so i dont have to worry about that. if you put the weights on the inside or front of the rim they fit fine.<P>these wheels also came on cavalier Z24's which is what i got them off from.<P><BR>my fiero seat covers were shot and i got the grand am seats for free so i am happy for now.<P><BR>if nobody buys it then i am going to save up and have a pro change engines for me next year since i cant use my parents garage.||||reg||1
